abstract:
This article provides bounds on the size of a 3-uniform linear hypergraph with restricted matching number and maximum degree. In particular, we show that if a 3-uniform, linear family $\mathcal{F}$ has maximum matching size $
u$ and maximum degree $\Delta$ such that $\Delta\geq  rac{23}{6}
u(1+ rac{1}{
u-1})$, then $|\mathcal{F}|\leq \Delta 
u$.
